===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*strēlaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*strēlō||arrow, ray, beam}}, from {der|ang|ine-pro|*strēl-}} {{m|ine-pro|*strēlā-||arrow, beam}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|strāla}}, {{cog|dum|strael}} ({{cog|nl|straal}}), {{cog|goh|strāla}} ({{cog|de|Strahl}}). The {{cog|ine-pro|-}} root is also the source of {{cog|sla-pro|*strěla}} ({{cog|ru|стрела}}).
